"Speed limits, connections per torrent, upload slots and seeding are set for each torrent when you add it, or later under Torrent Settings. Torrents use the proxy from the Connection tab (HTTP or SOCKS5, or the Mac's proxy with \"Use the system settings\") and the speed limit for all downloads. Changes apply to torrents started afterwards. Peers and trackers can see your IP address, or your proxy's." = "Mipaka ya kasi, uhusiano kwa kila torrent, kupakua slots na mbegu ni kuweka kwa kila torrent wakati wewe kuongeza, au baadaye chini ya Mipangilio Torrent. Torrents kutumia proxy kutoka Connection tab (HTTP au SOCKS5, au Mac ya proxy na \"Kutumia mipangilio ya mfumo\") na kikomo cha kasi kwa ajili ya kupakua zote. Mabadiliko kutumika kwa torrents kuanza baadaye. Peers na trackers wanaweza kuona anwani yako ya IP, au proxy yako.";
"Settings used for every download from a website. A site also covers its subdomains (example.com covers www.example.com). Logins are only sent to that site and are kept with the app's other secrets." = "Mipangilio inayotumiwa kwa kila kupakua kutoka tovuti. Tovuti pia inajumuisha anwani zake za chini (example.com inajumuisha www.example.com). Vitambulisho hutumwa tu kwenye tovuti hiyo na huhifadhiwa pamoja na siri nyingine za programu.";
"A backup holds your settings, site settings, queues and the downloads list. Passwords and cookies are never put in a backup." = "Sanduku la kumbukumbu lina mipangilio yako, mipangilio ya tovuti, foleni na orodha ya kupakua. Nenosiri na vidakuzi havipelekwi kwenye sanduku la kumbukumbu.";
